WEBVTT

NOTE LUMO, The Gospel of Luke 12:1-59 (Arclight 6_GOLuke2613), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-11-06.

1
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.050
I tell you, my friends,

2
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.310
do not be afraid of those who kill the body

3
00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.100
and after that can do no more.

4
00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:48.790
But I will show you whom you should fear:

5
00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:52.100
Fear him who, after your body has been killed,

6
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.600
has authority to throw you into hell.

7
00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:59.550
Yes, I tell you, fear him.

8
00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.550
Are not five sparrows sold for two pennies?

9
00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.650
Yet not one of them is forgotten by God.

10
00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:11.950
Indeed, the very hairs of your head are all numbered.

11
00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:14.750
Don't be afraid;

12
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.050
you are worth more than many sparrows.
